OL,3,AOpenAI investigating 'dozens' of
OL,4,Ainstances of agents acting improperly
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI said Friday it had alerted
OL,7,F"dozens" of global institutions that
OL,8,Ftheir websites may have been impacted
OL,9,Fby its AI agents acting improperly.
OL,11,FThe technology attempted to get
OL,12,Finformation from "governments,
OL,13,Funiversities, public agencies, and
OL,14,Fother institutions" through sometimes
OL,15,Fextreme means, the company said.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
