OL,3,AOpenAI investigating 'dozens' of
OL,4,Ainstances of agents acting improperly
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile some of the activity was due to
OL,7,Fthe tools working to find
OL,8,F"authoritative sources of public
OL,9,Finformation", some went beyond that.
OL,10,FLike an AI agent taking and
OL,11,Ftransferring data when it should not
OL,12,Fhave, OpenAI said.
OL,14,FSuch activity resulted in at least 53
OL,15,Fincidents where an OpenAI agent took an
OL,16,Fimage from ChatGPT user activity and
OL,17,Ftransferred it elsewhere.
